      "description": "<p>When a combustive zombie dies, its body explodes in a 30 foot burst of fire and debris that deals <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">3d10</span> bludgeoning damage and <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">3d10</span> fire damage to each creature in the area (DC 25 basic Reflex save).</p>",
